1
00:00:00,954 --> 00:00:03,164
Yeah, l've learned something today.

2
00:00:03,665 --> 00:00:06,665
You and l, in so many ways...

3
00:00:06,835 --> 00:00:10,335
(Sheldon:)...other than intelligence
and what counts, we're the same.

4
00:00:12,841 --> 00:00:15,221
(Mrs Cooper:)Sweetheart, are you sick?

5
00:00:15,385 --> 00:00:18,725
(Sheldon:)I hope so, because if this is well,
Iife isn't worth living.

6
00:00:18,888 --> 00:00:22,728
Sugar pie, you are burning up.
We've got to get you to bed.

7
00:00:22,892 --> 00:00:24,062
- Okay.
- Don't worry.

8
00:00:24,227 --> 00:00:27,067
(Mrs Cooper:)Mama's here to take care of her baby.

9
00:00:27,230 --> 00:00:31,570
(Sheldon:)And just to be clear, only her baby
and not these other people.

10
00:00:31,734 --> 00:00:33,574
(Sheldon:)Of course.

11
00:00:33,736 --> 00:00:36,656
(Sheldon:)Can I have tea with honey
and toast with the crust cut off?

12
00:00:36,823 --> 00:00:42,243
- You can have whatever you want.
- Brr. Thanks, Mom. You're the best.

13
00:00:49,919 --> 00:00:54,549
(Mrs Cooper:)Boy, last time I put VapoRub on you,
you didn't have hair on your chest.

14
00:00:55,091 --> 00:01:00,021
(Sheldon:)I know, it filled in last year.

